-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
-- Library seed batch: novels, open textbooks, past papers & study clips
--
-- EVERY URL in this file was machine-verified live before seeding
-- (scripts/verify_seed_urls.py — 215 URLs checked, PDF magic bytes /
-- HTML body / YouTube oEmbed / image content-type). Per product rule:
-- "if the url doesn't lead into book, past paper, novel then don't seed".
--
-- Contents:
--   • 26 public-domain novels / set works (Project Gutenberg readable HTML)
--   • 18 open textbooks (OpenStax CC-BY, direct PDF)
--   • 45 ZIMSEC O/A-Level specimen papers (official zimsec.co.zw PDFs)
--   • 17 Cambridge IGCSE June-2024 papers (official freely-published PDFs,
--     with marking schemes attached where published)
--   • 25 study clips (verified-live YouTube from trusted educational channels)
--
-- Idempotent: NOT EXISTS on (title, curriculum). The
-- library_resource_classify trigger keeps kind/video_url/pdf_url coherent.
-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

